rmed_tool_not_published_retry_b_only`, `test_c10_rw001_drain_form_created_fails_closed_without_tool`, `test_c10_rw001_drain_permission_reject_continues_and_reasoning_delivered`, `test_c10_rw001_drain_error_classification_preserved`, `test_c9_rw001_idless_and_unconfirmed_native_step`, `test_c8_rw002_unpaired_surrogate_raises_serve_protocol_error_in_sse_and_json`, `test_c6_rw004_ac016_serve_step_interruption_matrix`, `test_c6_rw004_ac017_unmapped_recovery_serve_vs_run_equivalence`), `tests/test_step_interruption.py` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-013`, `REQ-014`, `REQ-015`, `REQ-016` / `AC-018`, `AC-019`, `AC-020`, `AC-021` (ротация прокси, строгая валидация `usage`, потолок `_MAX_SERVE_NATIVE_TOOLS = 128` и учёт UTF-8 размеров `call_id`, `name`, `text` и `input` в `_ServeToolState` / `_serve_tool_state_bytes` / `_serve_accumulated_bytes`, работа `_drain_serve_step_usage` от общей очереди событий `events` с сохранением лимитов байт SSE-строки и HTTP-тела, маскирование пароля serve и секретов, `O-EXIT/v1` с `transport`, `first_event_ms`, `ttft_ms`) | `bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py` (`_serve_env`, `OPENCODE_DB=\":memory:\"`, `_ServeToolState`, `_serve_tool_state_bytes`, `_drain_serve_step_usage`, `O-EXIT/v1`) | `tests/test_realtime_reasoning.py` (`test_c11_rw006_tool_name_and_call_id_counted_in_state_bytes_main_and_drain`, `test_c10_rw004_tool_count_and_state_bytes_caps`, `test_c10_rw004_tool_state_byte_cap_main_and_drain_cleanup`, `test_c9_fu001_serve_queue_and_accumulated_byte_budget_enforced`, `test_c8_fu001_multiple_native_tool_calls_same_step_preserved_next_step_excluded`, `test_c7_fu001_native_tool_call_captures_step_ended_usage`, `test_c6_fu001_fu002_sse_line_body_byte_caps_and_strict_usage_ints`, `test_c6_fu001_oversized_sse_line_is_terminal_invalid_event`), `tests/test_run_env.py` | `VER-001-pytest` (`rc=0`) | `PASS` |\n| `REQ-017` / `AC-022`, `AC-023` (приведение базовой линии `test_step_interruption.py` в зелёное при `MAX_TOTAL_SPAWNS=